  "html": "<h1>Raw Confluence Storage</h1>\n<p>A pasted status macro passes straight through:</p>\n<ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"status\" ac:schema-version=\"1\">\n<ac:parameter ac:name=\"colour\">Green</ac:parameter>\n<ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Done</ac:parameter>\n</ac:structured-macro>\n<p>A layout whose cells contain markdown that still gets converted:</p>\n<ac:layout>\n<ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_equal\">\n<ac:layout-cell>\n<p>Left column with <strong>bold</strong> and a <a href=\"https://example.net\">link</a>.</p>\n</ac:layout-cell>\n<ac:layout-cell>\n<p>Right column with a list:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>one</li>\n<li>two</li>\n</ul>\n</ac:layout-cell>\n</ac:layout-section>\n</ac:layout>\n<p>Storage format inside a code fence stays literal:</p>\n<ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[<ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\"/>]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>",
  "warnings": []
}
